# Library Management System

A console-based Library Management System built in VB.NET 
using Object-Oriented Programming (OOP) concepts.

## Features
- Add, search, and manage books
- Student registration and management
- Book issuing and returning
- Automatic fine calculation for late returns
- Account management
- Menu-driven console interface

## Technologies Used
- VB.NET
- Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)
- Collections (Lists & Dictionaries)

## OOP Concepts Applied
- Classes and Objects
- Encapsulation
- Inheritance

## Project Structure
- `Book` class — manages book records
- `Student` class — manages student data
- `Account` class — handles account operations
- `LibraryManagement` class — core library logic

## How to Run
1. Clone the repository
2. Open the project in Visual Studio
3. Build and run the solution

